    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28535" root="عرب" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَرْبٌ</span></b>  is <i>syn. with</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِعْرَابٌ</span> in the sense of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِفْصَاحٌ</span>
[but app. as a subst. (not an inf. n.) meaning
<i>Clear, plain,</i> or <i>distinct, speech</i>]. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And
<i>syn. with</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِرَابَةٌ</span>, q. v. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <i>syn. with</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَرَبٌ</span> <i>as</i> [inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَرِبَ</span>, and] <i>meaning</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَشَاطٌ</span> [i. e.
<i>Briskness, liveliness,</i> or <i>sprightliness</i>]. (O, K.)

